178 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 129 0 R
/E (FlashEats is a web-based online canteen management system designed to streamline the process of food ordering and order management within a campus environment. Traditional canteen ordering systems are often manual, time-consuming, and lack proper tracking, which leads to long queues, order delays, and inefficient communication between students and canteen staff.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
179 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 129 0 R
/E (The proposed system provides a digital platform where students can securely register, log in, browse the menu, and place food orders. The system includes role-based access control, allowing administrators to efficiently manage menu items, monitor incoming orders, and update order statuses in real time.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
180 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 129 0 R
/E (FlashEats is developed using the MERN stack \(MongoDB, Express.js, React.js, Node.js\) and incorporates modern features such as JWT-based authentication and OTP verification using SendGrid for secure email-based verification. The application ensures secure role-based authorization for different users such as students and administrators.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
181 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 129 0 R
/E (The system is designed to improve efficiency, reduce waiting time, and enhance the overall user experience in campus food ordering by digitizing the entire canteen workflow without relying on traditional manual processes.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
