/E (In many educational institutions, canteen management still relies on traditional methods such as manual ordering at counters or verbal communication between students and staff. These approaches are often inefficient, lack proper tracking, and frequently result in long waiting times, order mismatches, and delayed service.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
